  "licence": "CC0 1.0 (\"Our assets are all licensed as CC0\", https://polyhaven.com/license)",
  "page": "https://polyhaven.com/a/terrazzo_tiles",
  "changes": "recoloured from its red-brown to a pale warm grey, its chips kept, and its roughness scaled by 0.6 (to about 0.17, smoother than the photograph) so that it shows a soft blurred sheen of the ceiling panels and no mirror image",
  "note": "neutral: the photograph is a strong red-brown, mean (137, 109, 87), and smooth, roughness 0.28; the floor of a public hall is light and matt to satin. The colour map is scaled to the colour given here and the roughness map by 0.6, to about 0.17, which with the fittings of build.py shows a soft blurred sheen of a panel and no mirror image; the first look round had it at 1.5 (matt, no sheen at all), the very first at 1.0 and under (a mirror of the ceiling)",
